[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","question_text":"达人营销从策略分析到达人选择怎么做？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"清洗版补充池","sample_date":"2026-10-12","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":23,"valid_url_cards":11,"unique_url_events":10,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"c5b639f15e7d60e8d376d48178f9e8525f26e20698efc5144c0328d30a48a0ef","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 达人营销：从策略分析到达人选择完整流程\n核心逻辑：**先定目标→做策略拆解→搭建达人矩阵→分层筛选达人→核验风险→评估性价比**，达人粉丝量不是第一指标，**人群重合度、内容真实性、商单历史表现**优先级更高。\n\n## 一、策略分析阶段（先把策略定好，再找人）\n### 1. 明确营销目标（决定后面达人类型、考核指标）\n先确定本次Campaign核心目标，目标不同，达人选型完全不一样：\n- **品牌曝光/新品种草**：提升认知、破圈。重点看内容感染力、圈层影响力，考核播放、曝光、搜索增量。适合头部/垂类中腰部达人\n- **人群渗透/口碑铺量**：积累真实口碑，铺垫搜索。大量KOC、小垂类达人，考核评论真实度、关键词种草\n- **销售转化/带货收割**：成交、ROI。优先看历史同类品转化、GPM、购物车点击率，选择带货型达人\n> 多目标组合：新品一般「头部破圈 + 中腰部种草 + KOC铺口碑」组合\n\n### 2. 人群&产品分析\n1）目标TA画像：年龄、性别、城市、消费力、兴趣、痛点、购买场景；需要看达人粉丝画像和TA重合度，不是只看粉丝总数\n2）产品属性：客单价、决策周期、卖点、使用场景；低客单价冲动型适合短视频挂车；高客单价需要深度讲解、体验种草\n3）竞品对标：扒竞品投放达人清单，看哪些垂类达人持续产出爆款，作为达人池候选来源\n\n### 3. 平台选择+预算分配+达人矩阵模型\n- 平台：小红书侧重种草口碑；抖音短视频+直播转化；B站深度内容科普；视频号私域+信任转化\n- 金字塔达人矩阵（通用配比，可按预算调整）\n  - 头部KOL（5%）：百万粉+，品牌背书、破圈引爆，预算占比高，量少\n  - 中腰部垂类达人（15%-25%）：10w~100w粉，人群精准，种草转化主力\n  - 尾部达人/KOC（70%-80%）：千粉~10w粉，真实口碑，铺量，性价比高\n- 预算拆分：坑位费/佣金、投流、内容制作、备用金；确定结算模式：纯坑位、坑位+佣金、纯佣金置换\n\n### 4. 内容策略&考核指标\n- 内容方向：测评、场景使用、干货科普、开箱、真实体验；提前明确brief\n- 核心KPI：曝光、互动率、CPE、GPM、点击率、ROI、品牌词搜索量\n\n## 二、达人选择阶段：4步筛选（初筛→精筛→背调→终审）\n### Step1：初筛，搭建候选达人池\n**渠道来源**\n1. 官方平台：巨量星图、小红书蒲公英、B站花火\n2. 第三方工具：蝉妈妈、新红等，提取竞品合作达人、垂类榜单达人\n3. 品牌自有：品牌评论区、品牌粉丝里的原生达人\n4. MCN机构推荐\n\n初筛门槛（快速过滤）\n1. 赛道匹配：同品类/同场景账号，优先看过往同类产品爆款\n2. 粉丝画像匹配：年龄、性别、地域、消费力与目标人群重合\n3. 账号健康度：无违规限流、无重大舆情、账号稳定更新\n> 初筛出来的候选池数量，建议是最终签约数量的**3倍**，留足挑选空间\n\n### Step2：精筛，多维打分（最关键）\n#### ① 内容&人设调性（定性）\n- 账号风格、人设价值观和品牌调性是否一致；数据再好，人设违和直接淘汰\n- 随机抽近10~20条日常内容：看内容质量、实拍能力、表达自然度\n- 重点看**历史商单内容**：商单和日常内容差距大不大，会不会广告感很重、评论区反感多\n\n#### ② 数据真实性（定量，防刷量）\n不要只看点赞，重点看：\n- 互动率：(点赞+评论+收藏)/播放；垂类账号互动率要高于大盘均值\n- 评赞比：评论质量，看评论是不是真实用户提问、讨论产品，不是统一水军话术\n- 数据稳定性：近30条内容播放/互动波动，忽高忽低大概率刷量\n- 转化指标（带货目标必看）：近30天同类商品GPM、购物车点击率、历史ROI、客单价是否匹配你的产品价格带\n\n#### ③ 商业化履约能力\n- 过往合作口碑：是否按时交稿、改稿配合度\n- 报价性价比：计算CPM、CPE，对比同赛道达人均价；区分坑位费、佣金、附加费用\n- 合作权限：是否允许投流、素材二次授权、能否挂链接\n\n### Step3：风险背调（避坑）\n1. 舆情排查：历史言论、过往翻车事件、负面新闻\n2. 广告合规：是否遵守广告法，不夸大宣传；有没有虚假种草前科\n3. 竞品排他：是否正在直接竞品合作，有无排他协议\n4. 账号状态：是否频繁删稿、限流、断更\n\n### Step4：终审 & 达人分级入库\n- 对候选达人打分表综合评分，分S/A/B/C级\n  - S/A：优质长期合作达人，优先复用\n  - B：潜力达人，小预算测试合作\n  - C：淘汰\n- 建立达人库，记录达人信息、粉丝画像、历史合作数据、报价、优缺点，方便后续复用\n\n## 三、达人选定后：建联、测试与复盘（策略闭环）\n1. 建联：发送brief，沟通内容方向、交付节点、权益、报价、合同\n2. 小预算测试：优先B级潜力达人小批量测试，验证素材和转化，再放大优质达人\n3. 投放复盘：统计达人内容数据、转化ROI，更新到达人档案，优化下一轮达人策略\n\n## 快速避坑要点\n1. ❌ 不要只看粉丝量，**泛流量大号不如小而精准垂类达人**\n2. ❌ 不要只看单条爆款，要看长期数据稳定性、商单内容表现\n3. ❌ 不要忽略评论区，评论区是判断粉丝真实度的核心\n4. ✅ 达人矩阵不能单一，组合投放分散风险\n\n\n\n要不要我给你一份可直接复制使用的**达人筛选打分表模板**（含指标、权重、评分项）？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:1","title":"MKT科普，达人种草推广全流程SOP #达人投放","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7694694059836164274","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7694694059836164274","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:2","title":"一文详解:怎么选对一个与产品匹配的达人 | 人人都是产品经理","raw_url":"https://www.woshipm.com/it/5158607.html","normalized_url":"https://www.woshipm.com/it/5158607.html","host":"www.woshipm.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:3","title":"新人做达人营销不踩坑指南，全流程五步讲清楚\n\n从立项到放量，达人营销完整五步：\n\n自我剖析｜人群策略｜KOL选号｜内容策略｜流量放大\n\n每一步是干嘛的、判断标准是什么，视频里都讲了。\n\n新人入行第一课","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7637477912954719153","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7637477912954719153","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:4","title":"小红书达人投放全流程SOP#合肥营销#新媒体运营#品牌推广#合肥达人探店#合肥","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7589203917859606629","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7589203917859606629","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:5","title":"巨量星图短直联动产品介绍-星图营销服务平台","raw_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/142728","normalized_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/142728","host":"www.xingtu.cn","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:6","title":"关于达人筛选+ 多重复用达人价值+配套投流全套实战完整方法论，这都是我们花了上千万预算、合作上千个品牌的总结，达人不要乱找！粉丝高≠效果好，解决商家花钱找达人没曝光、有播放不出单 #本地生活 #探店达人 #商家运营 #稳顺传媒#实体商家做抖音","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7677191313709031790","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7677191313709031790","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:7","title":"一文详解:怎么选对一个与产品匹配的达人 | 人人都是产品经理","raw_url":"https://www.woshipm.com/it/5158607.html","normalized_url":"https://www.woshipm.com/it/5158607.html","host":"www.woshipm.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:8","title":"品牌投放达人矩阵策略。#新媒体运营#合肥营销#品牌推广#内容营销#合肥探店达人","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7595892263424290021","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7595892263424290021","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:9","title":"达人建联全流程：3步精准筛选与高效邀约。Q1: 怎么建联达人，完整流程的第一步如何精准筛选匹配对象？ A1: 建联达人的核心不是广撒网，而是基于数据维度精准锁定高匹配度账号，建议通过“平台+带货指标+","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7685645108141757922","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7685645108141757922","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:10","title":"万字解析 | 品牌在抖音破圈到收割的完整闭环 | 人人都是产品经理","raw_url":"https://www.woshipm.com/marketing/5992887.html","normalized_url":"https://www.woshipm.com/marketing/5992887.html","host":"www.woshipm.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:11","title":"完整的抖音达人数据分析该怎么做? - 蝉妈妈运营圈","raw_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/question/4618.html","normalized_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/question/4618.html","host":"www.chanmama.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:12","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:13","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:14","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:15","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:16","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:17","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:18","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:19","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:20","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:21","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:22","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-3c8ccb57aecc468aa6422ac33f7d30f3:23","title":null,"raw_url":null,"normalized_url":null,"host":null,"source_type":"unresolved","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","question_text":"达人营销从策略分析到达人选择怎么做？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"清洗版补充池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":16,"valid_url_cards":16,"unique_url_events":15,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"f7bdc7c196b88210c4bda7f17ed2c9d48f6beb018f7b11dc92332ec71c16fd20","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# 达人营销：从策略分析 → 达人选择完整流程\n整体逻辑：**先定目标、人群、预算与矩阵策略，再圈选池子→多维度筛选→背调校验→分级打分→确定名单**，不要上来直接找达人。\n\n## 一、策略分析阶段（先把底层逻辑定下来）\n### 1. 明确项目目标 & KPI（目标决定达人类型）\n先区分核心目的，KPI分层，不要同时追求所有指标：\n- **品牌曝光/破圈**：看曝光、触达、品牌搜索量、A1-A3人群增长，优先头部/垂类大KOL\n- **种草心智**：看笔记收藏、评论正向度、看后搜、A3种草人群，优先中腰部+大量KOC\n- **转化带货**：点击、进店、GPM、ROI、成交，优先带货型垂类达人、直播达人\n\n> 一句话：目标不同，达人筛选权重完全不一样。做品牌曝光，粉丝体量权重高；做种草转化，**人群匹配度、商单内容自然度、评论质量权重更高**。\n\n### 2. 人群与竞品分析\n1. **品牌TA画像**：年龄、性别、地域、消费力、兴趣标签、痛点、购买场景。达人粉丝画像要和TA重合，**粉丝量高≠人群匹配**\n2. **竞品达人复盘**：扒竞品投放过哪些达人，哪些达人出爆文/高转化，哪些踩坑；看竞品达人的内容切入点、评论区用户反馈，作为达人池种子名单\n\n### 3. 平台策略与达人金字塔矩阵搭建\n按金字塔搭建组合，分配预算比例（经典模型）：\n- **头部KOL（5%预算）**：百万粉+，品牌背书、破圈，少量，做话题引爆\n- **中腰部KOL（15–25%预算）**：10万–100万粉，垂类专业度强，种草+转化主力\n- **尾部达人+KOC（70–80%预算）**：千粉~10万粉，真实口碑，铺量营造全网口碑，搜索长尾，性价比高\n\n同时确定合作形式：短视频/图文种草、直播专场、直播切片、探店、合集测评等。\n\n### 4. 预算规划、风险与投放节奏\n- 拆分：固定坑位费+佣金+投流+内容复用费+备用金\n- 风险策略：预留小预算做**达人小批量测试**，测试跑通后再放量；设置舆情兜底规则（达人过往负面、违规历史排查）\n- 输出：达人营销Brief，写明核心信息、禁止话术、CTA、交付物、数据追踪（UTM/专属码）、版权使用权限\n\n## 二、达人选择阶段（池子圈选 → 初筛 → 精筛 → 背调打分）\n### Step1：圈选达人池子（种子池）\n来源渠道：\n1. 官方平台：巨量星图、小红书蒲公英等达人广场，按类目、粉丝画像筛选\n2. 竞品/行业爆款内容：扒竞品合作达人、垂类爆款作者\n3. 第三方工具：蝉妈妈、新红等，筛选垂类账号、爆文账号\n4. 达人自荐、MCN机构推荐\n\n> 池子要放大：目标投放20个达人，池子至少准备50–80个备选，留足淘汰空间。\n\n### Step2：初筛（快速过滤，淘汰明显不匹配）\n快速淘汰项，满足任意一条直接剔除：\n1. 赛道不匹配：内容类目和产品无关\n2. 粉丝画像偏差大：年龄/地域/购买力和目标人群差异大\n3. 账号异常：数据忽高忽低，评论区水军多、清一色模板评论\n4. 舆情风险：过往有负面、品牌翻车、违规、竞品深度绑定\n5. 商业内容质量差：过往商单硬广感极强，播放/互动大幅低于日常内容\n\n### Step3：精筛（五大评估维度，打分表）\n#### ① 人群匹配度（权重最高）\n粉丝年龄、性别、城市、兴趣标签、消费层级；看粉丝重合度，而不是总粉丝量。\n\n#### ② 内容&人设调性匹配\n达人日常人设、内容风格是否和品牌调性一致；**调性违和，数据再好也慎选**。\n检查近10–20条原生内容：完播、点赞、收藏、评论质量、选题能力、实拍质感。\n\n#### ③ 商业化历史表现（重点）\n- 对比：达人**商单内容 vs 原生内容**，互动衰减是否严重（衰减大=粉丝反感硬广）\n- 同类产品合作案例：有没有投放过同品类，当时的种草/转化数据，品牌是否复投\n- 核心指标：爆文率、CPE、CPM、看后搜、购物车点击率、GPM（带货场景）\n- 评论区：看真实用户提问、讨论，而不是只看点赞数\n\n#### ④ 账号健康度&风险背调\n- 更新稳定性、粉丝增长趋势，有无大量掉粉\n- 历史舆情、违规记录、是否频繁接竞品广告\n- MCN履约口碑、达人沟通配合度、是否容易拖稿、改稿困难\n\n#### ⑤ 性价比评估\n报价、坑位费/佣金，横向对比同量级垂类达人，计算预估CPM/CPE，不是越便宜越好，要看**有效触达成本**。\n\n### Step4：打分分级 & 小批量测试\n1. 制作达人评分表，设置权重，对备选达人打分，分为S/A/B/C档，优先S/A档；B档做小预算测试；C档淘汰。\n2. 小规模测试：少量B档潜力达人先行投放，验证内容、人群、转化，测试结论再指导放量。\n3. 建立达人库：合作达人归档标签（品类、效果、配合度、报价），沉淀长期合作达人池。\n\n## 三、达人选择避坑要点\n1. ❌ 不要只看粉丝总量，**垂类小达人的精准人群往往优于泛流量大号**\n2. ❌ 不要只看表面点赞，重点看评论区真实需求讨论、收藏、搜索等种草指标\n3. ❌ 一次性大量投放未验证达人，容易预算翻车；坚持小测再放量\n4. ✅ 一定要看达人**历史商单**，原生内容好不等于广告内容效果好\n5. ✅ 签合作前确认版权、内容发布时长、数据回传、负面处理条款\n\n## 四、交付物清单（你落地可以直接用）\n1. 达人营销策略文档：目标、TA、竞品分析、预算分配、达人金字塔矩阵、投放节奏\n2. 达人Brief（单页版）：核心卖点、禁忌话术、CTA、交付物、版权、数据埋点\n3. 达人筛选打分表（可Excel）\n4. 达人备选池清单+背调记录表\n\n如果你需要，我可以直接给你一份可复制的**达人筛选打分Excel模板**，或者针对抖音/小红书单独写一版精简策略。","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-a7dadc0477b3443e95272cad6586cdbd:1","title":"MKT科普，达人种草推广全流程SOP #达人投放","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7694694059836164274","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7694694059836164274","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-a7dadc0477b3443e95272cad6586cdbd:2","title":"一文详解:怎么选对一个与产品匹配的达人 | 人人都是产品经理","raw_url":"https://www.woshipm.com/it/5158607.html","normalized_url":"https://www.woshipm.com/it/5158607.html","host":"www.woshipm.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-a7dadc0477b3443e95272cad6586cdbd:3","title":"新人做达人营销不踩坑指南，全流程五步讲清楚\n\n从立项到放量，达人营销完整五步：\n\n自我剖析｜人群策略｜KOL选号｜内容策略｜流量放大\n\n每一步是干嘛的、判断标准是什么，视频里都讲了。\n\n新人入行第一课","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7637477912954719153","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7637477912954719153","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-a7dadc0477b3443e95272cad6586cdbd:4","title":"小红书达人投放全流程SOP#合肥营销#新媒体运营#品牌推广#合肥达人探店#合肥","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7589203917859606629","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7589203917859606629","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown",