477b3443e95272cad6586cdbd:9","title":"万字解析 | 品牌在抖音破圈到收割的完整闭环 | 人人都是产品经理","raw_url":"https://www.woshipm.com/marketing/5992887.html","normalized_url":"https://www.woshipm.com/marketing/5992887.html","host":"www.woshipm.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-a7dadc0477b3443e95272cad6586cdbd:10","title":"完整的抖音达人数据分析该怎么做? - 蝉妈妈运营圈","raw_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/question/4618.html","normalized_url":"https://www.chanmama.com/yunyingquan/question/4618.html","host":"www.chanmama.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-a7dadc0477b3443e95272cad6586cdbd:11","title":"达人运营｜优质达人的判断标准 判断一个达人是否优质，我不会只看粉丝量，而是从五个维度综合评估。\n第一是粉丝匹配度——粉丝的画像是否覆盖品牌目标人群。第二是内容生产能力——达人能否将赛事内容和商品自然结合。第三是历史表现——过往内容的点击率和互动率是否稳定。第四是商业潜力——历史合作效果和品牌复投情况。第五是圈层影响力——达人在目标圈层中是否有可信度。\n最终我们不是选数据最高的达人，而是选跟当前品牌","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7666405441747897651","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7666405441747897651","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-a7dadc0477b3443e95272cad6586cdbd:12","title":"短视频-达人广场筛选功能介绍-星图营销服务平台","raw_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/114908","normalized_url":"https://www.xingtu.cn/help-center/demander/114908","host":"www.xingtu.cn","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-OTHER-R01-CQ-Q0164","question_id":"CQ-Q0164","citation_id":"smp-a7dadc0477b3443e95272cad6586cdbd:13","title":"达人筛选核心数据｜品牌投放评估全维度指南\n#品牌推广 #达人投放 #新媒体运营 #种草 #商家投放指南","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7